[thin] The soda bore has 1.7133 mm face backing and the two 4 mm flavor bores each have 2.8383 mm face backing after the rim and bore entrance chamfers. The round stock is centered on their circumcenter and on X=0. The nominal braided diameter is 34 mm within the 34.93 mm counter opening; braid folds and physical feeding are unmeasured.
alternatives: Larger stock thickens these walls but uses the remaining 0.465 mm nominal radial braid clearance. Moving bores inward reduces the internal webs or requires more Y displacement. Less rim relief adds material while reducing feeding relief.
